    "detailed_description": "You awaken in a mysteriously malfunctioning elevator, trapped and disoriented.<br>Navigate between floors, avoid the locals, and escape the building alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And never turn your back on the MATRESHKA.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/84c0f1b60c9f4847aba2d9aa1fd8c946.avif?t=1754271919\" width=616 height=348 /></span><br><br><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong><br>Solve intricate puzzles that require logic, observation, and creativity. Each solution brings you one step closer to freedom but also deeper into the building's mysteries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.poster.avif?t=1754271919\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.webm?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.mp4?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong><br>Explore a meticulously recreated Soviet-era building, filled with authentic details and a haunting atmosphere that brings history to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/0abb1bff0626282781592cac4a8ca5e9.avif?t=1754271919\" width=616 height=318 /></span><br><br><strong>Interactive Environment</strong><br>Every floor presents unique challenges and interactive elements. Search for clues, collect useful items, and manipulate the environment to uncover the building's secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.poster.avif?t=1754271919\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.webm?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.mp4?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Locals</strong><br>Beware of the building's inhabitants, whose behaviors and motives are unpredictable. Some may help, others may hinder, and a few might be outright dangerous.",
    "about_the_game": "You awaken in a mysteriously malfunctioning elevator, trapped and disoriented.<br>Navigate between floors, avoid the locals, and escape the building alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And never turn your back on the MATRESHKA.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/84c0f1b60c9f4847aba2d9aa1fd8c946.avif?t=1754271919\" width=616 height=348 /></span><br><br><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong><br>Solve intricate puzzles that require logic, observation, and creativity. Each solution brings you one step closer to freedom but also deeper into the building's mysteries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.poster.avif?t=1754271919\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.webm?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/be491a5c9d6fa911ee0b2742985f8f2b.mp4?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong><br>Explore a meticulously recreated Soviet-era building, filled with authentic details and a haunting atmosphere that brings history to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/0abb1bff0626282781592cac4a8ca5e9.avif?t=1754271919\" width=616 height=318 /></span><br><br><strong>Interactive Environment</strong><br>Every floor presents unique challenges and interactive elements. Search for clues, collect useful items, and manipulate the environment to uncover the building's secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.poster.avif?t=1754271919\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.webm?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890910/extras/cfb1e99bca33947bf8cde16f67bbff85.mp4?t=1754271919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Locals</strong><br>Beware of the building's inhabitants, whose behaviors and motives are unpredictable. Some may help, others may hinder, and a few might be outright dangerous.",
